WEBVTT

00:08:56.580 --> 00:09:01.476
You're kind of, like,
doing a lot and trying really hard,

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:04.216
but is it really changing anything?

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:06.956
AG: That feeling Conrey had is important.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.504
Research shows that one of the major
causes of burnout

00:09:09.528 --> 00:09:11.176
is a lack of efficacy,

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:14.266
feeling incapable of making an impact.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:16.446
CC: I think I felt the most burnt out

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:20.316
when I felt like all the hours
that I was putting in,

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.506
I really couldn't tell
if it was making a difference.

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.626
And are you really moving
the needle for kids

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.346
who really deserve more?

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:32.077
AG: How much of the burnout experience
was a sense of guilt?